        "created_at": "2019-12-06T07:49:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>First of all, <em>very</em> interesting character. I'd love to learn more about him, considering that mana and alternate dimensions aren't really pre-established things in Sentinels canon. (There are realms and timelines, but not dimensions as far as I'm aware.)</p>\n<p>To answer your question, \"a combination of instinct and experience\" sounds more like Intuition than Deduction to me. Even stuff like muscle memory and guessing based on past experience could be described as Intuition from a narrative standpoint, whereas Deduction I imagine as more of an active trait than a passive one like it sounds like this would be.</p>",
