        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/4491bb/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-12-06T18:48:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Godai\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/godai/48/1920_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Godai:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Intuition. Your description for Deduction is still intuition. Even educated guess are still guesses.&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<br>\nThank you Godai! That's the direction I was leaning.\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"VGBM\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/vgbm/48/2020_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> VGBM:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>First of all,&nbsp;<em>very</em>&nbsp;interesting character. I’d love to learn more about him, considering that mana and alternate dimensions aren’t really pre-established things in Sentinels canon. (There are realms and timelines, but not dimensions as far as I’m aware.)</p>\n<p>To answer your question, “a combination of instinct and experience” sounds more like Intuition than Deduction to me. Even stuff like muscle memory and guessing based on past experience could be described as Intuition from a narrative standpoint, whereas Deduction I imagine as more of an active trait than a passive one like it sounds like this would be.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I am tearing a lot of elements for this character out of other things, notably Fate/Stay Night and other things written by Kinoko Nasu. Avalon started as a thought experiment, and eventually ended up as an interesting character. This is probably my favorite version of him so far.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Sea-Envy\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/sea-envy/48/1849_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Sea-Envy:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>catDreaming if i may ask is this a Nuada Airgetlám character to pair with Avalon, the living sheath</p>\n<p>do you use these characters in a medium other than tabletop games?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I actually don’t know much about&nbsp;Nuada Airgetlám, but this character is a possible Avalon. Sounds like I should research Nauda though, and maybe end up making a couterpart to Avalon. I do a little writing on Facebook sometimes, and my characters tend to show up there.</p>",
